contract.content:
{
  "action": "execute",
  "archetype": "ai-tool",
  "message": "Building an internal policy search and Q&A tool: employees ask plain-English questions and get AI-generated answers with citations to SharePoint-sourced policy documents. Includes browse/search, automatic SharePoint ingestion, an admin analytics dashboard (top searches, content gaps, usage), and a compliance audit log of every query and answer.",
  "flags": ["has-users", "has-admin", "ai-rag", "sharepoint", "search-ui"],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "scope": "database",
      "summary": "Set up storage for users, indexed policy documents, SharePoint source configs, and a compliance audit log of every query.",
      "task": "Tables: users, sources, documents, queries, audit_log. Indexes: documents(source_id), documents(updated_at DESC), queries(user_id), queries(created_at DESC), audit_log(created_at DESC), users(oidc_sub). Column-level contract: data_model.",
      "dockerfile": "Dockerfile.postgres",
      "rules": [],
      "snippets": [],
      "primarySnippet": ""
    },
    {
      "scope": "vectordb",
      "summary": "Set up the vector store that powers semantic search and AI answers over policy document chunks.",
      "task": "pgvector extension. Table: doc_chunks(id SERIAL PK, document_id INTEGER NOT NULL, chunk_index INTEGER, content TEXT, embedding vector(3072), metadata JSONB, created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()). Index: HNSW on embedding (vector_cosine_ops). Index on document_id. Embedding model: text-embedding-3-large via MGA /embeddings.",
      "dockerfile": "Dockerfile.pgvector",
      "rules": [],
      "snippets": [],
      "primarySnippet": "vectordb/vectordb-connections.ts"
    },
    {
      "scope": "backend",
      "summary": "Build the API that answers employee questions with citations, lists/searches policies, syncs from SharePoint, powers the admin dashboard, and writes the audit log.",
      "task": "Data: pg Pool from env; pgvector connection on :5433. Endpoints + bodies: api_contract. Behaviors + rules + side-effects: business_logic_contract. Auth: x-amzn-oidc-data JWT (sub, email); auto-provision users row on first request. Role: 'admin' inferred from configured allowlist env ADMIN_EMAILS; default 'employee'. RAG: embed query via MGA text-embedding-3-large, top-k cosine search on doc_chunks, pass chunks + question to MGA assistant 'default' (claude-opus-4.7), return answer + citations referencing source documents. SharePoint sync: scheduled job per source pulls docs, chunks, embeds, upserts. Every /ask and /search writes to audit_log and queries.",
      "dockerfile": "Dockerfile.node",
      "rules": [],
      "snippets": [],
      "primarySnippet": "backend/express-server-template.ts"
    },
    {
      "scope": "frontend",
      "summary": "Build the employee Q&A and search interface plus the admin analytics dashboard.",
      "task": "Views + components: ui_contract. Endpoints + body shapes: api_contract (prepend /api/). States: spinner during ask/search, empty-state CTA on no results, toast on 4xx/5xx, 404 page, disabled submit during POST, streaming-style loader on /ask. Citations render as clickable links to document detail. Admin route gated by /whoami role==='admin'. Responsive.",
      "dockerfile": "Dockerfile.react",
      "rules": [],
      "snippets": [],
      "primarySnippet": "frontend/AppScaffold.tsx"
    },
    {
      "scope": "integration",
      "summary": "Wire all services together for local development with a single docker compose up.",
      "task": "Wire database, vectordb, backend, frontend. Backend env: DATABASE_HOST=database, DATABASE_PORT=5432, DATABASE_NAME=policyqa, DATABASE_USER=policyqa_user, DATABASE_PASSWORD=localdev123, VECTORDB_HOST=vectordb, VECTORDB_PORT=5433, MGA_API_KEY, MGA_BASE_URL, ADMIN_EMAILS. nginx.local.conf proxy /api→backend:3000. depends_on chain: frontend→backend→{database,vectordb}. Healthchecks on db services. Volumes per service.",
      "dockerfile": "",
      "rules": [],
      "snippets": [],
      "primarySnippet": "integration/docker-compose-fullstack.yml"
    }
  ],
  "data_model": {
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "users",
        "columns": [
          {"name": "id", "type": "SERIAL PRIMARY KEY"},
          {"name": "oidc_sub", "type": "TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "email", "type": "VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "role", "type": "VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'employee'"},
          {"name": "created_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "sources",
        "columns": [
          {"name": "id", "type": "SERIAL PRIMARY KEY"},
          {"name": "name", "type": "VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "kind", "type": "VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'sharepoint'"},
          {"name": "site_url", "type": "TEXT NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "library", "type": "VARCHAR(255)"},
          {"name": "last_synced_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ"},
          {"name": "status", "type": "VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active'"},
          {"name": "created_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "documents",
        "columns": [
          {"name": "id", "type": "SERIAL PRIMARY KEY"},
          {"name": "source_id", "type": "INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES sources(id)"},
          {"name": "external_id", "type": "TEXT NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "title", "type": "VARCHAR(512) NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "url", "type": "TEXT NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "author", "type": "VARCHAR(255)"},
          {"name": "content_text", "type": "TEXT"},
          {"name": "version", "type": "VARCHAR(64)"},
          {"name": "updated_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()"},
          {"name": "indexed_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "queries",
        "columns": [
          {"name": "id", "type": "SERIAL PRIMARY KEY"},
          {"name": "user_id", "type": "INTEGER REFERENCES users(id)"},
          {"name": "kind", "type": "VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "question", "type": "TEXT NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "answer", "type": "TEXT"},
          {"name": "citations", "type": "JSONB"},
          {"name": "result_count", "type": "INTEGER"},
          {"name": "created_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "audit_log",
        "columns": [
          {"name": "id", "type": "SERIAL PRIMARY KEY"},
          {"name": "user_id", "type": "INTEGER REFERENCES users(id)"},
          {"name": "user_email", "type": "VARCHAR(255)"},
          {"name": "event_type", "type": "VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL"},
          {"name": "payload", "type": "JSONB"},
          {"name": "created_at", "type": "TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()"}
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "api_contract": {
    "version": 1,
    "endpoints": [
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/whoami",
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ id, email, role }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/ask",
        "request": {"question": "string required"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ id, question, answer, citations: [{ document_id, title, url, snippet }] }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search",
        "request": {"q": "string required", "limit": "number optional default 50", "offset": "number optional default 0"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ results: [{ document_id, title, url, snippet, score }], total }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/documents",
        "request": {"limit": "number optional default 50", "offset": "number optional default 0"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ items: [{ id, title, url, source_name, updated_at }], total }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/documents/:id",
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ id, title, url, author, version, updated_at, source_name, content_text }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/admin/sources",
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ items: [{ id, name, site_url, library, status, last_synced_at }] }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/admin/sources",
        "request": {"name": "string required", "site_url": "string required", "library": "string optional"},
        "response": {"status": 201, "body": "{ id, name, site_url, library, status }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/admin/sources/:id/sync",
        "response": {"status": 202, "body": "{ id, status: 'syncing' }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "path": "/admin/sources/:id",
        "response": {"status": 204, "body": ""}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/admin/analytics/top-searches",
        "request": {"limit": "number optional default 20", "days": "number optional default 30"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ items: [{ question, count, last_asked_at }] }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/admin/analytics/content-gaps",
        "request": {"limit": "number optional default 20", "days": "number optional default 30"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ items: [{ question, count, avg_result_count }] }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/admin/analytics/document-usage",
        "request": {"limit": "number optional default 20", "days": "number optional default 30"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ items: [{ document_id, title, citation_count }] }"}
      },
      {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/admin/audit-log",
        "request": {"limit": "number optional default 50", "offset": "number optional default 0"},
        "response": {"status": 200, "body": "{ items: [{ id, user_email, event_type, payload, created_at }], total }"}
      }
    ]
  },
  "ui_contract": {
    "primary_view": "AI Q&A page where employees ask policy questions and get cited answers",
    "primary_action": "ask a plain-English policy question",
    "secondary_views": [
      "search results page",
      "policy browse list",
      "policy detail page",
      "admin dashboard with analytics",
      "admin source library management",
      "admin audit log viewer"
    ],
    "components": [
      {"name": "AskBar", "role": "primary plain-English question input"},
      {"name": "AnswerCard", "role": "AI-generated answer with inline citation chips"},
      {"name": "CitationList", "role": "list of source documents cited in the answer"},
      {"name": "SearchBar", "role": "keyword search input for browsing policies"},
      {"name": "ResultList", "role": "ranked search results with snippets"},
      {"name": "DocumentDetail", "role": "full policy document view with metadata"},
      {"name": "DocumentBrowser", "role": "paginated list of all indexed policies"},
      {"name": "AdminDashboard", "role": "analytics overview: top searches, content gaps, document usage"},
      {"name": "TopSearchesPanel", "role": "ranked list of most frequent questions"},
      {"name": "ContentGapsPanel", "role": "questions with poor or no results"},
      {"name": "DocumentUsagePanel", "role": "most-cited documents"},
      {"name": "SourceManager", "role": "admin CRUD for SharePoint sources and sync triggers"},
      {"name": "AuditLogViewer", "role": "compliance log of every query and answer"}
    ]
  },
  "business_logic_contract": {
    "triggers": [
      {"event": "user_first_request", "action": "create users row from OIDC claims (sub, email); role='admin' if email in ADMIN_EMAILS else 'employee'"},
      {"event": "question_asked", "action": "embed question, retrieve top-k chunks from vectordb, call MGA assistant for answer, return answer with citations, persist to queries, write audit_log entry"},
      {"event": "search_performed", "action": "run keyword + vector search over documents, persist to queries, write audit_log entry"},
      {"event": "source_added_or_sync_triggered", "action": "fetch documents from SharePoint, upsert documents rows, chunk and embed via MGA, upsert doc_chunks, update sources.last_synced_at"},
      {"event": "scheduled_sync", "action": "periodically resync all active sources to keep indexed content current"}
    ],
    "rules": [
      "all authenticated employees can read all documents, run /ask, /search, /documents (global access, no department filtering in v1)",
      "/admin/* endpoints require users.role='admin' — return 403 otherwise",
      "users are auto-provisioned from x-amzn-oidc-data JWT (sub, email) on first request",
      "every /ask and /search call must write a queries row and an audit_log row before responding",
      "answers must include citations referencing real document ids retrieved from the vector store"
    ],
    "side_effects": [
      "audit_log entry written on every /ask, /search, source mutation, and source sync",
      "queries row written on every /ask and /search for analytics aggregation"
    ]
  },
  "vector_engine": "pgvector",
  "mga_assistants": [
    {
      "key": "default",
      "name": "Policy Q&A Assistant",
      "description": "Answers employee questions about internal policies, procedures, and compliance guidance using indexed SharePoint documents. Always grounds answers in retrieved content and returns citations.",
      "model": "claude-opus-4.7",
      "tool_keys": [],
      "starter_messages": [
        "What is our policy on remote work?",
        "How do I submit an expense report?",
        "What are the compliance requirements for handling customer data?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
